        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maintenance, van &lt; 3.5t</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maintenance, van &lt; 3.5t
Data are merely rough estimates based on expert estimates.;
UUID: 02eccf23-5e44-37d2-b270-220b711b8705
The inventory includes materials used for alteration parts and energy consumption of garages. Rail and road transport of materials is accounted for
Location: Data represent Swiss conditions
Technology: no technologies are specified
Time period: Data represents conditions of the early 1990ties
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data partly based on expert estimates and partly on an LCI study of a German passenger car. 
Extrapolations: Data  for Switzerland and Germany is used as an first estimate for Europe
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_02eccf23-5e44-37d2-b270-220b711b8705.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
